@startuml AISOC-UseCase-Minimal
title AISOC — Use Case (Overview)

left to right direction
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam actorStyle awesome

' ─── Human actors (role hierarchy) ───
actor "SOC Analyst"        as Analyst
actor "Tier-2 Analyst"     as Tier2
actor "Incident Lead"      as Lead
actor "Administrator"      as Admin
actor "Super Admin"        as Super

Analyst <|-- Tier2
Tier2   <|-- Lead
Lead    <|-- Admin
Admin   <|-- Super

' ─── External / system actors ───
actor "Wazuh"              as Wazuh
actor "LLM Providers"      as LLM
actor "Notifications"      as Notify

rectangle "Aegis SOC Platform" {
  usecase "Ingest Alert"            as UC_Ingest
  usecase "AI Investigation\n(FP filter + multi-agent)" as UC_Invest
  usecase "Handle Incident"         as UC_Incident

  usecase "Triage Alerts"           as UC_Triage
  usecase "Investigate & Tune"      as UC_Tune
  usecase "Assign / Close Incident" as UC_Assign
  usecase "Administer Platform"     as UC_Admin
  usecase "Govern Admins"           as UC_Govern
}

' ─── Automated pipeline ───
Wazuh   --> UC_Ingest
UC_Ingest ..> UC_Invest  : <<include>>
UC_Invest --> LLM
UC_Invest ..> UC_Incident : <<extend>>
UC_Incident --> Notify

' ─── Human actors → key use cases ───
Analyst --> UC_Triage
Tier2   --> UC_Tune
Lead    --> UC_Assign
Admin   --> UC_Admin
Super   --> UC_Govern

@enduml
